  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government of the Solomon Islands pro bono legal training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In February 2025 an AGS lawyer delivered 1 day of pro bono training on statutory interpretation to the Solomon Islands&apos; Public Solicitor&apos;s Office in Honiara, Solomon Islands. Preparation was also undertaken by AGS lawyers for anticipated pro bono training in 2025/2026 on civil procedure to the Solomon Islands&apos; Public Solicitor&apos;s Office and on the Solomon Islands&apos; Evidence Act to the Solomon Islands&apos; Public Solicitor&apos;s Office, Attorney General&apos;s Chambers and Office of the Director of Public Prosecutions in Honiara, Solomon Islands.</narrative>
  </description>
